                                <div class="uk-container">                
                    
<div class="uk-grid-margin uk-grid tm-grid-expand uk-child-width-1-1">
    
        
<div class="uk-dark uk-width-1-1@m">
    
        
            
            
            
                
                    <div class="uk-panel uk-text-meta uk-margin uk-text-center" uk-scrollspy-class><p><strong>Get to know us</strong></p></div>
<h1 class="uk-heading-small uk-margin-remove-top uk-text-center" uk-scrollspy-class>
    
        
                    Meet the Company        
        
    
</h1><div class="uk-panel uk-margin uk-width-xlarge uk-margin-auto uk-text-center" uk-scrollspy-class><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Perpetuals.com Ltd. (NASDAQ: PDC) is a financial technology company bridging traditional financial markets with blockchain-based infrastructure. Headquartered in Tokyo with operations across the USA, Europe and Asia, we develop software solutions that enable regulated trading venues to operate with 24/7 self-clearing and blockchain-based settlement technology, empowering institutions to compete in the evolving landscape of digital finance.</strong></p></div>
                
            
        
    
</div>
    
</div>
                                </div>                
                        </div>
            
        
        </div>
    
</div>
<div class="uk-section-default uk-section" uk-scrollspy="target: [uk-scrollspy-class]; cls: uk-animation-slide-top-small; delay: 200;">
    
        
        
        
            
                                <div class="uk-container">                
                    
<div class="uk-grid tm-grid-expand uk-margin-large" uk-grid>
    
        
<div class="uk-width-1-2@m">
    
        
            
            
            
                
                    
<h2 uk-scrollspy-class>
    
        
                    Welcome to<br class="uk-visible@s" />Perpetuals.com        
        
    
</h2>
<div class="uk-margin" uk-scrollspy-class>
        <picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/media/yootheme/cache/86/photo_2026-02-01_04-26-55-86124d82.webp 768w, /media/yootheme/cache/3d/photo_2026-02-01_04-26-55-3db833e4.webp 1024w, /media/yootheme/cache/03/photo_2026-02-01_04-26-55-034ff929.webp 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 1280px"><img class="el-image" src="/images/photo_2026-02-01_04-26-55.jpg" alt loading="lazy" width="1280" height="960"></picture>    
    
</div>
                
            
        
    
</div>
<div class="uk-width-1-2@m">
    
        
            
            
            
                
                    <div class="uk-panel uk-margin-large" uk-scrollspy-class><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Perpetuals.com Ltd. (NASDAQ: PDC) emerged from a business combination between the Perpetuals.com Group—founded by Patrick Gruhn, Robin Matzke, and Nayia Ziourti—and EarlyWorks Co., Ltd., effective January 2026. Our team pioneered the introduction of tokenized stocks into the crypto market, enabling platforms such as Binance, FTX, and Bittrex to offer 24/7 tokenized stock trading. As Forbes reported, we were also behind the successful Coinbase Pre-IPO tokenized contracts, demonstrating as early as 2021 the transformative potential of blockchain-based financial solutions.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Today, we develop regulated financial and crypto market infrastructure powered by proprietary machine learning technology. Our AI analyzes profit and loss probabilities at the individual trade level, enabling safer financial products, enhanced client protection, and optimized risk management. Combined with EarlyWorks' blockchain technology, we eliminate the need for traditional clearing houses—delivering a true blockchain-native trading experience fully compliant with MiFID II and MiCA regulations.</p></div>
<div class="uk-accordion-default" uk-accordion="collapsible: true;" uk-scrollspy-class>
        
<div class="el-item">
    <a class="el-title uk-accordion-title" href>Regulated Infrastructure <span uk-accordion-icon></span></a>

    <div class="uk-accordion-content">
    
                <div class="el-content uk-panel"><p>Operating under CySEC License with full MiFID II, MiCA, DORA, and EMIR compliance.</p></div>                
    
    </div>
</div>        
<div class="el-item">
    <a class="el-title uk-accordion-title" href>24/7 Trading <span uk-accordion-icon></span></a>

    <div class="uk-accordion-content">
    
                <div class="el-content uk-panel"><p>Round-the-clock trading for crypto spot, derivatives, tokenized assets, and structured products.</p></div>                
    
    </div>
</div>        
<div class="el-item">
    <a class="el-title uk-accordion-title" href>AI-Powered Risk Intelligence <span uk-accordion-icon></span></a>

    <div class="uk-accordion-content">
    
                <div class="el-content uk-panel"><p>Proprietary machine learning predicting trade outcomes to protect clients and optimize hedging.</p></div>                
    
    </div>
</div>        
<div class="el-item">
    <a class="el-title uk-accordion-title" href>Institutional-Grade Technology <span uk-accordion-icon></span></a>

    <div class="uk-accordion-content">
    
                <div class="el-content uk-panel"><p>Hosted at Equinix FR2 Frankfurt alongside Eurex and Xetra for low-latency, high-frequency performance.</p></div>                
    
    </div>
</div>    
</div>
                
            
        
    
</div>
    
</div>
                                </div>                
            
        
    
</div>
<div class="uk-section-muted uk-section uk-section-large" uk-scrollspy="target: [uk-scrollspy-class]; cls: uk-animation-slide-top-small; delay: false;">
    
        
        
        
            
                                <div class="uk-container">                
                    
<div class="uk-grid-margin uk-grid tm-grid-expand uk-child-width-1-1">
    
        
<div class="uk-width-1-1">
    
        
            
            
            
                
                    
<div class="uk-margin">
    
        <div class="uk-grid uk-child-width-1-1 uk-child-width-1-2@m uk-grid-column-medium uk-grid-row-large uk-grid-match" uk-grid>                <div>
<div class="el-item uk-panel uk-margin-remove-first-child" uk-scrollspy-class>
    
        
            
                
            
            
                                

    
        <img class="el-image" src="/media/yootheme/cache/27/ourstory-271e5536.webp" alt loading="lazy" width="920" height="613" srcset="/media/yootheme/cache/6b/ourstory-6b46fbe6.webp 768w, /media/yootheme/cache/27/ourstory-271e5536.webp 920w, /media/yootheme/cache/fb/ourstory-fb696877.webp 1024w, /images/ourstory.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 920px) 920px">
        
    
                
                
                    

        
                <h2 class="el-title uk-h3 uk-margin-medium-top uk-margin-remove-bottom">Our Story</h2>        
        
    
        
        
                <div class="el-content uk-panel uk-margin-top"><p>Our journey began with a vision to transform how financial markets operate. The founding team pioneered regulatory-approved tokenized stocks, enabling major crypto exchanges to offer 24/7 stock trading for the first time. In 2021, we launched the Coinbase Pre-IPO tokenized contracts, proving that blockchain technology could unlock new possibilities in capital markets. In January 2026, we joined forces with EarlyWorks and its proprietary blockchain infrastructure to become Perpetuals.com Ltd. (NASDAQ: PDC), combining deep fintech expertise with cutting-edge distributed ledger technology to build the future of regulated digital finance.</p></div>        
        
        

                
                
            
        
    
</div></div>
                <div>
<div class="el-item uk-panel uk-margin-remove-first-child" uk-scrollspy-class>
    
        
            
                
            
            
                                

    
        <img class="el-image" src="/media/yootheme/cache/ca/whatwedo-ca316f77.webp" alt loading="lazy" width="920" height="613" srcset="/media/yootheme/cache/c6/whatwedo-c60ceeed.webp 768w, /media/yootheme/cache/ca/whatwedo-ca316f77.webp 920w, /media/yootheme/cache/92/whatwedo-923dcba9.webp 1024w, /images/whatwedo.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 920px) 920px">
        
    
                
                
                    

        
                <h2 class="el-title uk-h3 uk-margin-medium-top uk-margin-remove-bottom">What we do</h2>        
        
    
        
        
                <div class="el-content uk-panel uk-margin-top"><p>We build regulated financial market infrastructure that bridges traditional finance and blockchain technology. Our flagship platform, Kronos X®, enables trading venues to operate EU-regulated Multilateral Trading Facilities with 24/7 self-clearing and blockchain-based settlement, eliminating the need for traditional clearing houses. Powered by proprietary AI that analyzes trade-level risk in real-time, we offer crypto spot and derivatives trading, tokenized assets, structured products, and Pre-IPO contracts. Our technology is hosted at Equinix FR2 in Frankfurt alongside Europe's leading exchanges, fully compliant with MiFID II, MiCA, DORA, and EMIR.</p></div>        
        
        

                
                
            
        
    
</div></div>
                </div>
    
</div>
                
            
        
    
</div>
    
</div>
                                </div>                
            
        
    
</div>
<div class="uk-section-muted uk-section uk-section-large" uk-scrollspy="target: [uk-scrollspy-class]; cls: uk-animation-fade; delay: false;">
    
        
        
        
            
                                <div class="uk-container">                
                    
<div class="uk-grid-margin uk-grid tm-grid-expand uk-child-width-1-1">
    
        
<div class="uk-width-1-1@m">
    
        
            
            
            
                
                    
<div class="uk-margin" uk-scrollspy-class>
        <picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/media/yootheme/cache/89/company-talk-89574d69.webp 768w, /media/yootheme/cache/4a/company-talk-4a3e9c1f.webp 1024w, /media/yootheme/cache/fd/company-talk-fd3fb3a4.webp 1300w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) 1200px"><img class="el-image" src="/media/yootheme/cache/8d/company-talk-8d279793.jpg" alt loading="lazy" width="1200" height="526"></picture>    
    
</div>
                
            
        
    
</div>
    
</div>
